(*"management_resources_schema.attribute_type"
The **attribute_type** data type allows for the designation of a label or a text that can be assigned to an attribute of an entity.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment"
An **action_assignment** is an association of an <<express:action_schema.action,action>> with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment.assigned_action"
the instance of the <<express:action_schema.action,action>> entity data type that is to be associated with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment.role"
the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.object_role,object_role>> that specifies the purpose of the association of the **action_assignment** with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment.role.__note"
This attribute is an enhancement to the definition of *action_assignment* using a method that is upwardly compatible with ISO 10303-41:1994.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment.wr:WR1"
Each **action_assignment** shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.role_association.item_with_role,item_with_role>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.role_association,role_association>>.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_assignment.wr:WR1.__note"
A template for constraining the population of the entity data types defined in the <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> is described in annex E.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment"
An **action_method_assignment** is an association of an <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>> with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment.assigned_action_method"
the instance of the <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>> entity data type that is to be associated with the product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment.role"
the <<express:management_resources_schema.action_method_role,action_method_role>> that specifies the purpose of the association of the **action_method_assignment** with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment.role.__note"
The values related to this attribute can be specified in an annotated EXPRESS schema that uses or specializes this entity, or in an agreement of common understanding between the partners sharing this information.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role"
An **action_method_role** is a definition of a role for an <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>> and a description of that role.

The **action_method_role** for the <<express:management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment,action_method_assignment>> is 'Process to mill mechanical part'.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role.__example"
'Process XYZ' is an <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>>. An <<express:management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment,action_method_assignment>> assigns the <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>> to the definition of a specific mechanical part.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role.description"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.text,text>> that characterizes the **action_method_role**. The value of the attribute need not be specified.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role.name"
the <<express:support_resource_schema.label,label>> by which the **action_method_role** is known.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role.name.__note"
The meaning of this attribute can be defined in the annotated EXPRESS schemas that use or specialize this entity, or in an agreement of common understanding between the partners sharing this information.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_method_role.name.__note"
The entity data type <<express:management_resources_schema.action_method_assignment,action_method_assignment>> implements the association of the role with a specific <<express:action_schema.action_method,action_method>>.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment"
An **action_request_assignment** is an association of a <<express:action_schema.versioned_action_request,versioned_action_request>> with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.assigned_action_request"
the instance of the <<express:action_schema.versioned_action_request,versioned_action_request>> entity data type that is to be associated with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.role"
the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.object_role,object_role>> that specifies the purpose of the association of the **action_request_assignment** with product data.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.role.__note"
This attribute is an enhancement to the definition of *action_request_assignment* using a method that is upwardly compatible with ISO 10303-41:1994.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.role.__note"
The values related to this attribute can be specified in an annotated EXPRESS schema that uses or specializes this entity, or in an agreement of common understanding between the partners sharing this information.
*)

(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.wr:WR1"
Each **action_request_assignment** shall be the <<express:basic_attribute_schema.role_association.item_with_role,item_with_role>> in at most one <<express:basic_attribute_schema.role_association,role_association>>.
*)


(*"management_resources_schema.action_request_assignment.wr:WR1.__note"
A template for constraining the population of the entity data types defined in the <<express:basic_attribute_schema,basic_attribute_schema>> is described in annex E.
*)

